 Acids Res</source><year>2008</year><fpage>D440</fpage><lpage>444</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17984083</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gotz</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia-Gomez</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Terol</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>TD</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagaraj</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Nueda</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Robles</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Talon</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dopazo</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Conesa</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>High-throughput functional annotation and data mining with the Blast2GO suite</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2008</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>3420</fpage><lpage>3435</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18445632</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Benjamini</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Hochberg</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Controlling the false discovery rate&#x02013;a practical and powerful approach to multiple testing</article-title><source>J R Stat Soc Ser</source><year>1995</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>289</fpage><lpage>300</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Oligo Design &#x02013; Survey Of Available Programs</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://projects.cgb.indiana.edu/display/brp/Oligo+Design+Survey"/></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-gr